      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUMBUK JOHNNY (7) flew the lids with a sensational early split and led throughout to score an impressive win by a neck over 400m at this track (22.86). Has hit winning form and can measure up again. SUBLIME (4) box seated before sticking on well to finish 5.5 lengths away in third (23.09) at this track in a Grade 5 over 400m. Hard to beat again. AMBANI (6) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Athenian Goddess (23.07) in a Grade 5. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. Comes through a solid form race last start. Will give a great sight again. PAW XELA (1) gets a chance to redeem an unplaced effort here last start.",
